{
  "name": "Air Cargo Quote - Email intake",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Air Cargo Quote: email intake\nn8n only **orchestrates** here: it receives the email and hands it to the quote engine (`npm start`, port 3000).\nThe engine reads the email with AI, validates, prices **by code** and drafts the reply. **A person approves every reply** in the engine's approval page. Nothing is sent from here.\n\nTo test without a mailbox: activate the workflow and POST an email to `/webhook/quote-email` (see `n8n/README.md`).",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "d756376f-aedd-59ef-99d5-1cccd210fb4a",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Real mailbox\nAdd your IMAP credential to this node and enable it. Emails are marked as read after they are handed over.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 260,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "1275c768-f47a-5337-9b1d-ba6b3dca2c10",
      "name": "Note: IMAP",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -60
      ]
    },
